  Unicode.Generated.LineBreakPropertyData

  Materialized Line_Break range table (UCD 17.0.0) as a `List` literal so
  per-codepoint lookups reduce in the kernel without the String parser's axioms.
  `LBClass` is defined here to avoid a circular import; the parser and drift
  gate live in `Unicode.Generated.LineBreakProperty`.
-/

